.SH NAME
dtpcreceive \- Delay\-Tolerant Payload Conditioning reception test program
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBdtpcreceive\fR \fItopic_ID\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBdtpcreceive\fR uses DTPC to acquire application data items on topic \fItopic_ID\fR
sent by \fBdtpcsend\fR.  Upon termination it prints the total number of
application data items received and the mean rate of application data
transmission.
.PP
Use CTRL-C to terminate the program.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.ie n .IP 0 4
.el .IP \f(CW0\fR 4
